{{!
    @template local_targetzenit/mobile_main

    Mobil ilovaning asosiy paneli (0-bosqich).

    DIQQAT: bu HTML emas, ILOVA shabloni. `<table>`, `<div class="card">` kabi
    veb belgilari bu yerda ishlamaydi — Ionic komponentlari ishlatiladi
    (`<ion-list>`, `<ion-item>`, `<ion-label>`). Shablon Moodle tomonida
    render qilinadi, ilova esa natijani o'z komponentlariga aylantiradi.

    Til: `{{ 'plugin.local_targetzenit.<kalit>' | translate }}`. Satrlar
    `db/mobile.php` dagi `lang` ro'yxatiga kiritilgani uchun ilova ularni
    o'zi yuklab oladi.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * ism - foydalanuvchi ismi
    * bogli - hisobi Frappe yozuviga bog'langanmi
    * oylik_bor - oylik ma'lumoti bormi
    * jadval_bor - dars jadvali yuklanganmi
    * wwwroot, oylik_url, baho_url - veb sahifalarga havolalar

    Example context (json):
    {
        "ism": "Abdurashid Abdug'afforov",
        "bogli": true,
        "oylik_bor": true,
        "jadval_bor": true,
        "wwwroot": "https://lms.example.uz/local/targetzenit/index.php",
        "oylik_url": "https://lms.example.uz/local/targetzenit/oylik.php",
        "baho_url": "https://lms.example.uz/local/targetzenit/baholarim.php"
    }
}}
<ion-card>
    <ion-card-header>
        <ion-card-title>{{ 'plugin.local_targetzenit.app_welcome' | translate }}</ion-card-title>
        <ion-card-subtitle>{{ ism }}</ion-card-subtitle>
    </ion-card-header>
    <ion-card-content>
        <p>{{ 'plugin.local_targetzenit.app_ok' | translate }}</p>
        {{^ bogli }}
            <ion-note color="warning">
                {{ 'plugin.local_targetzenit.app_nolink' | translate }}
            </ion-note>
        {{/ bogli }}
    </ion-card-content>
</ion-card>

<ion-list>
    {{# jadval_bor }}
    <ion-item button="true" core-link="true" [href]="'{{ wwwroot }}'" detail="true">
        <ion-icon name="fas-calendar" slot="start"></ion-icon>
        <ion-label>
            <p class="item-heading">{{ 'plugin.local_targetzenit.timetable' | translate }}</p>
            <p>{{ 'plugin.local_targetzenit.app_openweb' | translate }}</p>
        </ion-label>
    </ion-item>
    {{/ jadval_bor }}

    <ion-item button="true" core-link="true" [href]="'{{ baho_url }}'" detail="true">
        <ion-icon name="fas-chart-bar" slot="start"></ion-icon>
        <ion-label>
            <p class="item-heading">{{ 'plugin.local_targetzenit.mygrades' | translate }}</p>
            <p>{{ 'plugin.local_targetzenit.app_openweb' | translate }}</p>
        </ion-label>
    </ion-item>

    {{# oylik_bor }}
    <ion-item button="true" core-link="true" [href]="'{{ oylik_url }}'" detail="true">
        <ion-icon name="fas-money-bill" slot="start"></ion-icon>
        <ion-label>
            <p class="item-heading">{{ 'plugin.local_targetzenit.mypayroll' | translate }}</p>
            <p>{{ 'plugin.local_targetzenit.app_openweb' | translate }}</p>
        </ion-label>
    </ion-item>
    {{/ oylik_bor }}
</ion-list>
